# Server API

- Mount new routers in `server/index.ts`. Public auth stays under `/api/auth` (rate-limited). Client documents use `requireAuth` + `requireClient`. Staff use `requireAuth` + `requireEmployee`.
- Fail with `{ error: string }` so `src/api/client.ts` can surface the message.
- Prefer `postgrest()` over a new Supabase SDK. If `supabaseConfigured()` is false, write to the existing in-memory maps.
- Do not change `public.users.password` into a second column. Hashing, if added, stays in that column.
- Do not “fix” `clients_applicatitons`.
- `admin` is on the session type and unused. Do not invent an admin console unless asked.
- Import shared types from `src/employees/types.ts` and PDF helpers from `src/js/`. Do not copy those types into `server/`.
